{"5451250":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"BELL SHOOTER","steam_appid":5451250,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No guns. Just bells!<\/h2>A brand-new kind of shooter: bounce bells off your ship and smash them into enemies.<br>It's easy to play. Just move under a bell and it bounces off toward the enemies.<br>Press Space to launch your bells at nearby enemies all at once.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 kinds of bells<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Normal<\/strong> - Bounces back for more hits. Strong against small fry<br><\/li><li><strong>Blast<\/strong> - Wipes out everything nearby. Strong against swarms<br><\/li><li><strong>Pierce<\/strong> - Punches right through shields. Strong against shielded enemies<br><\/li><li><strong>Split<\/strong> - Bursts into mini bells. Strong against big guys<\/li><\/ul>Right-click to switch colors. Hit an enemy with its weak color for a massive CRITICAL!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combos that never stop<\/h2>Keep your bells in the air and your combo keeps climbing: 100, 200 and beyond.<br>Enjoy the rush of wiping out a screen full of enemies with your bells.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 one-of-a-kind bosses<\/h2>King Slime, Bell Cat, Patchwork Bear, Jingle the Clown, Drifty Jelly and the Bell King.<br>Each boss has a different weak color, so switch bells and take them on.<br>Land a hit and watch them wince, rage and stick their tongues out at you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your ship gets fancier with every world<\/h2>Every time you clear a world, your ship, the Bell Wing, gets upgraded with flashier wings and colors.<br>Your upgraded ship also becomes your title on the leaderboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 worlds, 30 stages<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Blue sky, sunset, moonlit night, circus, deep sea and a crumbling world of bells. Every world brings new scenery and new attacks<br><\/li><li>One-life run: lose everything and start over from stage 1-1<br><\/li><li>Includes a tutorial, so you'll get the hang of it right away<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global leaderboard<\/h2>Compete with the points from the enemies you defeat. Supports Steam global and friends leaderboards.<br>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No guns. Just bells!<\/h2>A brand-new kind of shooter: bounce bells off your ship and smash them into enemies.<br>It's easy to play. Just move under a bell and it bounces off toward the enemies.<br>Press Space to launch your bells at nearby enemies all at once.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 kinds of bells<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Normal<\/strong> - Bounces back for more hits. Strong against small fry<br><\/li><li><strong>Blast<\/strong> - Wipes out everything nearby. Strong against swarms<br><\/li><li><strong>Pierce<\/strong> - Punches right through shields. Strong against shielded enemies<br><\/li><li><strong>Split<\/strong> - Bursts into mini bells. Strong against big guys<\/li><\/ul>Right-click to switch colors. Hit an enemy with its weak color for a massive CRITICAL!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combos that never stop<\/h2>Keep your bells in the air and your combo keeps climbing: 100, 200 and beyond.<br>Enjoy the rush of wiping out a screen full of enemies with your bells.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 one-of-a-kind bosses<\/h2>King Slime, Bell Cat, Patchwork Bear, Jingle the Clown, Drifty Jelly and the Bell King.<br>Each boss has a different weak color, so switch bells and take them on.<br>Land a hit and watch them wince, rage and stick their tongues out at you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your ship gets fancier with every world<\/h2>Every time you clear a world, your ship, the Bell Wing, gets upgraded with flashier wings and colors.<br>Your upgraded ship also becomes your title on the leaderboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 worlds, 30 stages<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Blue sky, sunset, moonlit night, circus, deep sea and a crumbling world of bells. Every world brings new scenery and new attacks<br><\/li><li>One-life run: lose everything and start over from stage 1-1<br><\/li><li>Includes a tutorial, so you'll get the hang of it right away<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global leaderboard<\/h2>Compete with the points from the enemies you defeat. Supports Steam global and friends leaderboards.<br>","short_description":"No guns. Just bells! Bounce 4 types of bells into enemies, strike weak spots for CRITICAL hits, and build massive combos! Defeat 6 unique bosses, upgrade your ship, and conquer 30 stages. Keep the bells flying and climb the global leaderboard!","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5451250\/48b76513b3f58ed4db6f328d5c7fb7e229606278\/header.jpg?t=1793696522","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5451250\/26040803f8288fe172fc01abe90c2eb9c9764db8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793696522","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5451250\/26040803f8288fe172fc01abe90c2eb9c9764db8\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793696522","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2Core 2.0GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 4Core 3.0GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong>